{"id":421170,"shortDescription":"Indivisible es un juego de plataformas RPG de acción dibujado a mano de Lab Zero, creadores de la aclamada Skullgirls. Ambientada en un enorme mundo de fantasía, Indivisible cuenta la historia de Ajna, una niña valiente con una racha rebelde que se embarca en una búsqueda para salvar todo lo que sabe de la destrucción.","developers":["Lab Zero Games"],"publishers":["505 Games"],"categories":["Un jugador","Multijugador","Cooperativo","Coop. a pantalla (com)partida","Pantalla partida/compartida","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Comodidad de la cámara","Controles de volumen personalizados","Dificultad ajustable","Opción solo teclado","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Sonido estéreo","Opciones de subtítulos","Steam Cloud","Remote Play en móvil","Remote Play en tableta","Remote Play en TV","Remote Play Together","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"8 OCT 2019","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/421170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1793373516","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/421170/ss_28feb815932e53b2ba703aae34cc868b34ef1b07.600x338.jpg?t=1793373516","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/421170/ss_28feb815932e53b2ba703aae34cc868b34ef1b07.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793373516"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/421170/ss_a8a9059289d7d31ccbd0f06e6e14ad685865b60c.600x338.jpg?t=1793373516","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/421170/ss_a8a9059289d7d31ccbd0f06e6e14ad685865b60c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793373516"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/421170/ss_459dc421bc1a89bc5ddb9f06a67b1bc20ae6586e.600x338.jpg?t=1793373516","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/421170/ss_459dc421bc1a89bc5ddb9f06a67b1bc20ae6586e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793373516"},{"thumb":"https://sh